              "tipe": "example",
              "judul": "Contoh",
              "konten": [
                { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Jika $f(x) = 2x + 1$, maka $f^{-1}(x) = \\dfrac{x - 1}{2}$." },
                { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Verifikasi: $f(f^{-1}(x)) = f\\left(\\dfrac{x-1}{2}\\right) = 2 \\cdot \\dfrac{x-1}{2} + 1 = x - 1 + 1 = x$ ✓" }
